---
// Hero: mark + wordmark, one-liner, primary waitlist CTA + secondary Bluesky follow.
---

<header class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <img src="/kootana-symbol.svg" alt="" width="56" height="56" class="brand-mark" />
      <span class="brand-word">Kootana</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero-title">Your network, at every event.</h1>

    <p class="hero-sub">
      Kootana makes your professional network useful at the events you already
      attend. See who you already know in the room (before you enter), connect in
      a tap, and keep a
      record of who you met that follows you, not the app you met them in.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#waitlist" class="btn btn-primary">Join the waitlist</a>
      <a
        href="https://bsky.app/profile/kootana.social"
        class="btn btn-secondary"
        rel="me noopener"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Follow @kootana.social
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="hero-note">Building now. An app for iOS and Android.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding-block: clamp(64px, 12vw, 140px) clamp(48px, 8vw, 96px);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Magenta corner-wash, baked in — no image needed. */
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(60% 90% at 85% 0%, rgba(206, 93, 151, 0.18), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(50% 80% at 0% 100%, rgba(139, 126, 200, 0.1), transparent 55%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(32px, 6vw, 56px);
  }

  .brand-mark {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
  }

  .brand-word {
    font-family: var(--k-font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 28px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 4.25rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    margin-top: 20px;
    max-width: 58ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.06rem, 2.2vw, 1.2rem);
    color: var(--k-text-muted);
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .hero-note {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--k-text-muted);
  }
</style>
